#: ../../source/api/cli/data-process.md:1 d129e734ad4d4c9c8f3a1e58bb46617e
msgid "data_process.py 命令行参考"
msgstr "data_process.py Command Line Reference"

#: ../../source/api/cli/data-process.md:3 8f8640ad8bd440e48163782143771458
msgid ""
"`data_process.py` 是 UniKT "
"数据管线的统一命令行工具，提供数据集下载（`download`）与清洗切分处理（`process`）两个标准子命令。"
msgstr ""
"`data_process.py` is the unified command line tool for UniKT's data "
"pipeline, providing two standard subcommands: dataset downloading "
"(`download`) and cleaning/splitting processing (`process`)."

#: ../../source/api/cli/data-process.md:5 258edbc94e8b435a866a846d29d74629
msgid "子命令总览"
msgstr "Subcommand Overview"

#: ../../source/api/cli/data-process.md:7 b8296661a6c64c999616dd4981ce1113
msgid ""
"# 1. 下载原始数据集压缩包并解压至 data/<dataset>/raw/\n"
"python data_process.py download -d <dataset> [OPTIONS]\n"
"\n"
"# 2. 执行 ETL 清洗、紧凑映射、K 折划分与标准 Parquet 切分\n"
"python data_process.py process -d <dataset> [OPTIONS]\n"
msgstr ""
"# 1. Download raw dataset archive and extract to data/<dataset>/raw/\n"
"python data_process.py download -d <dataset> [OPTIONS]\n"
"\n"
"# 2. Execute ETL cleaning, compact mapping, K-fold splitting, and "
"standard Parquet slicing\n"
"python data_process.py process -d <dataset> [OPTIONS]\n"

#: ../../source/api/cli/data-process.md:17 35763c39316a4404b2138a8bf18dd703
msgid "1. `download` 子命令"
msgstr "1\\. `download` Subcommand"

#: ../../source/api/cli/data-process.md:19 51c81ebfcc4343e99464aeca9a38e6a8
